{"path":"numeric/random/RAND_MAX","title":"RAND_MAX","titleHtml":"RAND_MAX","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/random/RAND_MAX","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Expands to an integer constant expression equal to the maximum value returned by the function rand(). This value is implementation dependent.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/program\"><code>&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define RAND_MAX /*implementation defined*/</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Expands to an integer constant expression equal to the maximum value returned by the function <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/random/rand\">rand()</a></span>. This value is implementation dependent. It's guaranteed that this value is at least <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"nu0\">32767</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;limits.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;time.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/random/srand\"><span class=\"kw740\">srand</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/time\"><span class=\"kw513\">time</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"><span class=\"kw103\">NULL</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// use current time as seed for random generator</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"RAND_MAX:&nbsp;%i<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, RAND_MAX<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"INT_MAX:&nbsp;%i<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw364\">INT_MAX</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Random value on [0,1]:&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/random/rand\"><span class=\"kw741\">rand</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> RAND_MAX<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>RAND_MAX: 2147483647\nINT_MAX: 2147483647\nRandom value on [0,1]: 0.362509</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22/3 General utilities &lt;stdlib.h&gt; (p: 248)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22/3 General utilities &lt;stdlib.h&gt; (p: 340)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.20/3 General utilities &lt;stdlib.h&gt; (p: 306)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c89\">\n<ul><li> C89/C90 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1990): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 4.10 GENERAL UTILITIES &lt;stdlib.h&gt; \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/random/rand\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rand</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   generates a pseudo-random number  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/random/srand\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>srand</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   seeds pseudo-random number generator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/RAND_MAX\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>RAND_MAX</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"RAND_MAX","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Expands to an integer constant expression equal to the maximum value returned by the function rand()."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"References"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"rand","note":"generates a pseudo-random number"},{"label":"srand","note":"seeds pseudo-random number generator"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":143,"codeBlockCount":2}
